abstract: "Byte-level conformance vectors for the signature layer of x402: EIP-712 typed-data digests and secp256k1 recovery for the exact scheme on EVM (EIP-3009, Permit2 witness transfer, EIP-2612 permit), with the expected verdict, the reject class and the intermediate hashes of every vector, checked by a runner that needs only the Python standard library."
